# 统一换行：仓库内存 LF，检出时按平台处理，避免 Windows/macOS 协作时的整文件 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# 明确二进制，避免被当文本处理
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# 锁文件与生成物按语言高亮
*.json text
*.md text
*.py text
*.js text
*.css text
*.html text

# portfolio/demo/ 是 tools/build_static.py 的生成物，
# 在 diff 中折叠，避免污染代码审查视野
portfolio/demo/* linguist-generated=true
